hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"225","Yahya related to me from Malik, from Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi, from Abu Hurayra, that he used to say: \"The washing on the day of Jumu'ah is obligatory for every adult, like the washing for sexual impurity.\""
"226","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi that Abu Hurayra used to say"
"227","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Salim ibn Abdullah said"
"228","Yahya related to me from Malik from Safwan ibn Sulaym from Ata ibn Yasar from Abu Said al-Khudri that the Messenger of Allah"
"229","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"230","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"231","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Thalaba ibn Abi Malik al Quradhi informed him that in the time of Umar ibn al Khattab they used to pray on the day of jumua until Umar came out"
"232","Yahya related to me from Malik, from Nafi', that Abdullah ibn Umar saw two men talking while the Imam was delivering the sermon on the day of Jumu'ah, so he threw pebbles at them, saying: \"Be silent.\""
"233","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar saw two men talking while the imam was giving the khutba on the day of jumua and he threw pebbles at them to tell them to be quiet"
"234","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man sneezed on the day of jumua while the imam was giving the khutba"
"235","Yahya related to me from Malik that he asked Ibn Shihab about talking in the jumua after the imam had come down from the mimbar but before he had said the takbir. Ibn Shihab said"
"236","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab used to say"
"237",""
"238",""
"239","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn al-Had from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith at-Taymi from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf that Abu Hurayra said"
"240","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"241","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would never go to jumua without wearing oil and perfume except when it was forbidden (i.e. when he was muhrim)"
"242","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm from whoever related it to him that Abu Hurayra used to say"
"243","Yahya related to me from Malik from Damra ibn Said al-Mazini from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud that ad-Dahhak ibn Qays asked an-Numan ibn Bashir"
"244","Yahya related to me from Malik that Safwan ibn Sulaym said"
"245","Yahya related to me from Malik from Jafar ibn Muhammad from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
